meta {
  name: List Policies
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/hr/leave/policies
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: auth_token={{authToken}}
}

docs {
  ADMIN ONLY — needs hr.leave.admin.policies.view (hr_admin, hr_manager, hr_head,
  org_admin, tenant_admin). Expect 403 as an ordinary employee: every row carries
  accrual config, caps and approval depth for every revision, past and future.

  Employees get their leave data from GET /hr/leave/balances instead.
}
